specification to the Technical Committee’s email list. Others should send
comments to the Technical Committee by using the “Send A Comment” button on the
Emergency Management TC web page at <b><a
href="http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/"><span style='font-weight:
normal'>http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/.</span></a></b></p>

