<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181942">3.5.3 ResponseToRequestResource Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseToRequestResource:MessageID, ResponseToRequestResource:SentDateTime,
ResponseToRequestResource:MessageContentType, ResponseToRequestResource:OriginatingMessageID,
ResponseToRequestResource:PrecedingMessageID, ResponseToRequestResource:ContactInformation,
and ResponseToRequestResource:ResourceInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of ResponseToRequestResource:MessageContentType MUST be
“ResponseToRequestResource”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestResource:IncidentInformation element is
present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResponseToRequestResource:MessageRecall element is
present, then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestResource:Funding element is present, then
at least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and
ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID and
ResponseInformation:ResponseType elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or
Resource:TypeStructure elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:Resource element is present, then at
least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure element
MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction
element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation element is
present and the ResponseInformation:ResponseType contains a value of “Accept”
or “Provisional”, then the AssignmentInformation:Quantity element MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation is present then
ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType MUST be present and contain one of the
following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“EstimatedArrival”, “EstimatedDeparture”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“RequestedReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”,  “RequestedArrival”,
“RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnArrival”, “ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a ResponseToRequestResource
message can be found in Appendix A.4.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181943">3.5.4 Message Flow</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The ResponseToRequestResource message is sent by a Resource
Supplier in response to an original RequestResource message.</p>

<p class=normal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>The potential
responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequisitionResource (See Section 3.6).</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the ResponseToRequestResource:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181944"></a><a name="_Ref149026387">3.5.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>Below is an example of a ResponseToRequestResource Message.
This is an example response to the original request shown in Section 3.4.5 . In this example, the three requests have different responses:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The “Small Animal Sheltering Team” (ResourceInfoElementID=001)
has Conditional changes to the request. In this case the Schedule information
is different from that requested.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The “Patrol and Surveillance Helicopters” (ResourceInfoElementID=002)
is Declined.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The “Electrical Power Restoration Team” (ResourceInfoElementID=003)
is Accepted.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>[Note: The XML example
shown in this section is informative only.]</p>

