<h3><a name="_Toc189181948">3.6.3 RequisitionResource Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequisitionResource:MessageID, RequisitionResource:SentDateTime,
RequisitionResource:MessageContentType, RequisitionResource:OriginatingMessageID,
RequisitionResource:Funding, RequisitionResource:ContactInformation, and RequisitionResource:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequisitionResource:MessageContentType MUST be “RequisitionResource”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequisitionResource:IncidentInformation element is present,
then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the RequisitionResource:MessageRecall element is present, then
the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequisitionResource:Funding element is present, then at
least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID, ResourceInformation:Resource
and ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or
Resource:TypeStructure elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The AssignmentInformation:Quantity element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation is present, then the
ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain one of the
following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedArrival”,
“EstimatedDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”, “EstimatedReturnArrival”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”, “ReportTo”, or
“Route”</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a
RequisitionResource message can be found in Appendix A.5.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181949">3.6.4 Message Flow</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The <span lang=EN>Requisition</span>Resource message is a
message created and sent by the Resource Consumer to any number of Resource
Suppliers.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>CommitResource (See Section 3.7)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:.25in'><span
style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This includes Accept, Decline and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the RequisitionResource:MessageRecall element.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181950"></a><a name="_Ref21074553">3.6.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>Below is an example of a <span lang=EN>Requisition</span>Resource
Message, in which two resource <span lang=EN>requisitions </span>are shown:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>Small Animal Sheltering Team (ResourceInfoElementID=001)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>Patrol and Surveillance Helicopters (ResourceInfoElementID=002).</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

