<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181954">3.7.3 CommitResource Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The CommitResource:MessageID, CommitResource:SentDateTime, CommitResource:MessageContentType,
CommitResource:OriginatingMessageID, CommitResource:PrecedingMessageID, CommitResource:ContactInformation,
and CommitResource:ResourceInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of CommitResource:MessageContentType MUST be “CommitResource”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a CommitResource:IncidentInformation element is present, then
at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the CommitResource:MessageRecall element is present, then the
MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a CommitResource:Funding element is present, then at least one
of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and
ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Accept” or “Provisional”,
then the ResourceInformation:Resource element MUST be present. </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Accept” or “Provisional”,
then the ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation element MUST be present. If
ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Decline”, then the
ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation is not applicable.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Accept” or “Provisional”,
then the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element MUST be present. If
ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Decline”, then the
ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation is not applicable.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID and
ResponseInformation:ResponseType elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Provisional”,
then at least one of ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or ResponseInformation:ResponseReason
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:Resource element is present, then at
least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure elements
MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation is present, then at least one
of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation element is
present, then the AssignmentInformation:Quantity element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival “, “EstimatedDeparture”, “RequestedDeparture”,
“ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”, “EstimatedReturnArrival“, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
”EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “Committed”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”, “Current”,
“ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'><span style='background:yellow'> </span></p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a
CommitResource message can be found in Appendix A.6.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181955">3.7.4 Message Flow</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The CommitResource message is sent by a Resource Supplier in
response to either a RequestResource or RequisitionResource message sent by the
Resource Consumer.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the CommitResource:MessageRecall element.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181956"></a><a name="_Ref149461377">3.7.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>Below is an example of a CommitResource Message. This is an
example Response to the original RequisitionResource shown in Section 3.6.5. In this example, the two requests have different responses:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The “Small Animal Sheltering Team” (ResourceInfoElementID=001) is
Accepted. In this case the Schedule information is updated with Committed date.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The “Patrol and Surveillance Helicopters” (ResourceInfoElementID=002)
is Declined.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

