<h3><a name="_Toc189181960">3.8.3 RequestInformation Message rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequestInformation:MessageID, ResourceMessage:SentDateTime ResourceMessage:MessageContentType,
ResourceMessage:MessageDescription, ResourceMessage:OriginatingMessageID, and ResourceMessage:ContactInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequestInformation:MessageContentType MUST be “RequestInformation”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestInformation:IncidentInformation element is present,
then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceMessage:MessageRecall element is present, then the
MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestInformation:Funding element is present, then at least
one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestInformation:ResourceInformation element is present,
then the ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:Resource element is present, then at
least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure elements
MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation is present, then at least one
of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is present,
then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”, “RequestedDeparture”,
“EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “ActualReturnDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”, “EstimatedReturnArrival”,
“ActualReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”, “Committed”,
“Current”, “ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a
RequestInformation message can be found in Appendix A.7.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181961"><span lang=EN>3.8.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The RequestInformation message may be sent by the Resource
Consumer to any number of Resource Suppliers, or may it may be sent vice versa.
The RequestInformation message may follow earlier resource messages.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ResponseToRequestInformation (See Section 3.9)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ReportResourceDeploymentStatus</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This includes Accept, Decline, and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet align=center style='margin-left:0in;text-align:center;
text-indent:0in'>The message may be canceled or updated through the RequestInformation:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181962"></a><a name="_Ref149037978">3.8.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>Below is an example RequestInformation
messages. The first is intended as a follow up message to the RequestResource
and ResponseToRequestResource messages shown in Sections </span><span
lang=EN>3.4.5</span><span lang=EN> and </span><span
lang=EN>3.5.5</span><span lang=EN>, requesting further information about the
third resource that was requested (two electrical power restoration teams). </span></p>

