<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181972">3.10.3 OfferUnsolicitedResource Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The OfferUnsolicitedResource:MessageID, OfferUnsolicitedResource:SentDateTime
OfferUnsolicitedResource:MessageContentType, OfferUnsolicitedResource:OriginatingMessageID,
OfferUnsolicitedResource:ContactInformation, and OfferUnsolicitedResource:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of OfferUnsolicitedResource:MessageContentType MUST be
“OfferUnsolicitedResource”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If an OfferUnsolicitedResource:IncidentInformation element is
present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the OfferUnsolicitedResource:MessageRecall element is present,
then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST
be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>For each OfferUnsolicitedResource:ResourceInformation element,
the ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“EstimatedArrival”, “EstimatedDeparture”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“RequestedReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”, or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The schema for an OfferUnsolicitedResource message can be
found in Appendix A.9.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181973"><span lang=EN>3.10.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The OfferUnsolicitedResource message is an initial message
created and sent by the Resource Supplier to any number of Resource Consumers.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequestInformation (See Section 3.8)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequisitionResource (See Section 3.6)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the OfferUnsolicitedResource:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181974"></a><a name="_Ref167183156">3.10.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>Below is an example OfferUnsolicitedResource
message. This message offers a donation of 100 large and 100 small tarpaulins.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>[Note: The XML example
shown in this section is informative only.]</p>

<div style='border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:
solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 0in;
background:#E6E6E6;margin-left:.3in;margin-right:.3in'>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>&lt;?xml
version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>&lt;OfferUnsolicitedResource
xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>   
xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:msg </p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:.2in;
background:#E6E6E6'>  EDXL-RMOfferUnsolicitedResource.xsd&quot;</p>

