xmlns:xal=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:ciq:xal:3&quot;&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'> 
&lt;MessageID&gt;urn:au-qld-eoc:84313&lt;/MessageID&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'> 
&lt;SentDateTime&gt;2006-03-22T10:34:00+10:00&lt;/SentDateTime&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'> 
