<h3><a name="_Toc189181978">3.11.3 ReleaseResource Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ReleaseResource:MessageID, ReleaseResource:SentDateTime, ReleaseResource
Message:MessageContentType, ReleaseResource:OriginatingMessageID, ReleaseResource:ContactInformation,
and ReleaseResource:ResourceInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of ReleaseResource:MessageContentType MUST be “ReleaseResource”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ReleaseResource:IncidentInformation element is present, then
at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ReleaseResource:MessageRecall element is present, then the
MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ReleaseResource:Funding element is present, then at least
one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>For each ReleaseResource:ResourceInformation element, the
ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.  </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation element is present,
then the ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID and
ResponseInformation:ResponseType elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation element is present and
the ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Provisional”, then at
least one of ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or ResponseInformation:ResponseReason
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation element is
present, then the AssignmentInformation:Quantity element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST must be present
and contain one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”,
“RequestedDeparture” , “EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”,
“RequestedReturnDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “ActualReturnDeparture”
“RequestedReturnArrival”, “EstimatedReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”,
“EndAvailable”, “Committed”, “ReportTo”, “Current” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The schema for a ReleaseResource message can be found in
Appendix A.10.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181979"><span lang=EN>3.11.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The ReleaseResource message is sent by the Resource Consumer
to the Resource Supplier, and typically follows an earlier sequence of messages
(e.g., RequisitionResource and CommitResource messages).</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequestInformation (See Section 3.8)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequisitionResource (See Section 3.6) </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>Consumers waiting on the release of resources may send to a
RequisitionResource Message after receipt of a ReleaseResource Message.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the ReleaseResource:MessageRecall element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181980"></a><a name="_Ref151373528"></a><a
