<h3><a name="_Toc189181984">3.12.3 RequestReturn Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequestReturn:MessageID, ResourceMessage:SentDateTime, RequestReturn:MessageContentType,
RequestReturn:OriginatingMessageID, RequestReturn:ContactInformation, and RequestReturn:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequestReturn:MessageContentType MUST be “RequestReturn”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestReturn:IncidentInformation element is present, then
at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the RequestReturn:MessageRecall element is present, then the
MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestReturn:Funding element is present, then at least one
of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure
elements MUST be present for each ResourceInformation:Resource element present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”,
“RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“RequestedReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, “Committed”,  “EndAvailable”, “Current”,
“ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a RequestReturn
message can be found in Appendix A.11.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181985"></a><a name="_Toc153691721"></a><a
name="_Toc153709461"></a><a name="_Toc153254702"></a><a name="_Toc153254704"></a>3.12.4
Message Flow</h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The RequestReturn message is sent by the Resource Supplier
to the Resource Consumer, and typically follows an earlier sequence of messages
(e.g., RequisitionResource and CommitResource messages).</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ResponseToRequestReturn (See Section 3.13) </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ReleaseResource (See Section 3.11)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This includes Accept, Decline, and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the RequestReturn:MessageRecall element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

