<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181996">3.14.3 RequestQuote Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequestQuote:MessageID, RequestQuote:SentDateTime, RequestQuote:MessageContentType,
RequestQuote:OriginatingMessageID, RequestQuote:ContactInformation, and RequestQuote:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequestQuote:MessageContentType MUST be “RequestQuote”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestQuote:IncidentInformation element is present, then at
least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the RequestQuote:MessageRecall element is present, then the
MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestQuote:Funding element is present, then at least one
of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation element is
present, then the ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID” and
“ResponseInformation:ResponseType MUST be present. </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Conditional”,
then at least one of ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or ResponseInformation:ResponseReason
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure
elements MUST be present for each ResourceInformation:Resource element present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnDeparture”,
“EstimatedReturnArrival”, “ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The schema for a RequestQuote message can be found in Appendix
A.13.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181997"></a><a name="_Toc153254817"></a><a
name="_Toc153254819"></a><span lang=EN>3.14.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message Flow</span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The RequestQuote message is usually an initial message
created and sent by the Resource Consumer to any number of Resource Suppliers.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ResponseToRequestQuote (See 3.15)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This includes Accept, Decline, and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the RequestQuote:MessageRecall element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189181998"></a><a name="_Ref151369216">3.14.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>Below is an example RequestQuote message. This
message requests quotes for a “Debris Management Team” (ResourceInfoElementID=001)
and two “All Terrain Cranes” (ResourceInfoElementID=002).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>[Note: The XML example
shown in this section is informative only.]</p>

