&lt;Description&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:.2in;
background:#E6E6E6'>    5 person team to clear roads of debris incl. fallen
trees. &lt;/Description&gt;</p>

