<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>       
Team to supply own equipment, such as trucks and chainsaws</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>     
&lt;/SpecialRequirements&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>   
&lt;/Resource&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>   
&lt;AssignmentInformation&gt;</p>

<p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>     
&lt;Quantity&gt;</p>

