<h3><a name="_Toc189182002">3.15.3 ResponseToRequestQuote Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseToRequestQuote:MessageID, ResponseToRequestQuote:SentDateTime,
ResponseToRequestQuote:MessageContentType, ResponseToRequestQuote:OriginatingMessageID,
ResponseToRequestQuote:PrecedingMessageID, ResponseToRequestQuote:ContactInformation,
and ResponseToRequestQuote:ResourceInformation elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of ResponseToRequestQuote:MessageContentType MUST be
“ResponseToRequest Quote”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestQuote:IncidentInformation element is
present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResponseToRequestQuote:MessageRecall element is present,
then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST
be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestQuote:Funding element is present, then at
least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST be
present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResponseInformation:ResponseType element has a value of
“Accept” or “Provisional”, then the ResourceInformation:Resource element MUST
be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID and ResponseInformation:ResponseType
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Provisional”,
at least one of ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or ResponseInformation:ResponseReason
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or
Resource:TypeStructure elements MUST be present for each ResourceInformation:Resource
element present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:AssignmentInformation element is
present, then the AssignmentInformation:PriceQuote element MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“EstimatedArrival”, “RequestedArrival”, “RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedDeparture”,
“RequestedReturnDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”,
“EstimatedReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, EndAvailable”, “Current”, “ReportTo”
or “Route”. </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a ResponseToRequestQuote
message can be found in Appendix A.14.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182003"></a><a name="_Toc153254876"></a><a
name="_Toc153254878"></a><a name="_Toc153254879"></a><span lang=EN>3.15.4 </span><span
lang=EN>Message Flow</span></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The ResponseToRequestQuote message is sent by the Resource
Supplier to the Resource Consumer in response to a RequestQuote message.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>Request Information (See Section 3.8) </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>RequisitionResource (See Section 3.6).</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the ResponseToRequestQuote:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182004">3.15.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>Below is an example ResponseToRequestQuote
message. The message is a possible response to the RequestQuote message shown
in Section </span><span lang=EN>3.14.5</span><span lang=EN>. The first quote
request (“Debris Management Team”, </span>ResourceInfoElementID<span lang=EN>=001)
is accepted, while the second (“All Terrain Crane”, ResourceInfoElementID=002)
is declined.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>[Note: The XML example
shown in this section is informative only.]</p>

