<h3><a name="_Toc189182008"></a><a name="_Ref188432632">3.16.3 RequestResourceDeploymentStatus
Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:MessageID, RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:SentDateTime,
RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:MessageContentType, RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:OriginatingMessageID,
RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:ContactInformation, and RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:MessageContentType
MUST be “RequestResourceDeploymentStatus”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:IncidentInformation element
is present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:MessageRecall element is
present, then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:Funding element is present,
then at least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo elements MUST
be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure
element MUST be present for each ResourceInformation:Resource element present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”, “RequestedDeparture”,
“EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”,
“EstimatedReturnDeparture”, “ActualReturnDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”, “EstimatedReturnArrival”,
“ActualReturnArrival”, “BeginAvailable”, “EndAvailable”, “Committed”, “Current”,
“ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a RequestResourceDeploymentStatus
message can be found in Appendix A.15.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182009"><span lang=EN>3.16.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The RequestResourceDeploymentStatus message can be sent from
the Resource Supplier to the Resource Consumer, or from the Resource Consumer
to the Resource Supplier, any time after a resource is requisitioned or
committed.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ReportResourceDeploymentStatus (See Section 3.17)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This may include Accept, Decline, and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the RequestResourceDeploymentStatus:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3>3.16.5  <a name="_Toc189182010">Message Example</a></h3>

