message. This message requests the deployment status of the “Small Animal
Sheltering Team”; it follows on from the example CommitResource message in
Section </span><span lang=EN>3.7.5</span><span lang=EN>, and precedes the ReleaseResource
message in Section </span><span lang=EN>3.11.5</span><span lang=EN> .</span></p>

