Reference Model (ERM) tailored for the ReportResourceDeploymentStatus Message. The
</span><span lang=EN>ERM shows the element-level details for the main entities
in the RM.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN><img border=0 width=623 height=486
src="EDXL-RM-v1.0-OS-errata-os_files/image018.jpg"></span></p>

<p class=MsoCaption><a name="_Ref153691452">Figure </a>17: EDXL-RM ERM for ReportResourceDeploymentStatus
