<h3><a name="_Toc189182020">3.18.3 RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageID, RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:SentDateTime,
RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageContentType, RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:OriginatingMessageID,
RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:ContactInformation, and RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:ResourceInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageContentType
MUST be “RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:IncidentInformation
element is present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageRecall element is
present, then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and MessageRecall:RecallType
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:Funding element is
present, then at least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:Resource
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or
Resource:TypeStructure element MUST be present for each ResourceInformation:Resource
element present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or
OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is present,
then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”,
“RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”,
“EstimatedReturnArrival”, “RequestedReturnDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnDeparture”,
“Committed”, “Current”, “ReportTo” <br>
 or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>The schema for a
RequestExtendedDeploymenDuration message can be found in Appendix A.17.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182021"><span lang=EN>3.18.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration message is sent from
the Resource Consumer to the Resource Supplier after the Commit Resource
message and prior to the Release Resource message. </p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The potential responses to this message include:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration (See Section 3.19)</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>This includes Accept, Decline and Provisional responses.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.25in'>&nbsp;</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182022"></a><a name="_Ref151459858">3.18.5 Message Example</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>Below is an example
RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration message. This message follows on from the
CommitResource message in Section </span><span
lang=EN>3.7.5</span><span lang=EN> and preceeds the RequestReturn and
ReleaseResource messages in Sections </span><span
lang=EN>3.12.5</span><span lang=EN> and  </span><span
lang=EN>3.11.5</span><span lang=EN> respectively.</span></p>

