<h2><a name="_Ref149553683"></a><a name="_Ref151455726"></a><a
name="_Toc189182023"></a><a name="_Ref188433539"><span lang=EN>3.19 </span><span
lang=EN>ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration</span></a><span lang=EN>
Message</span></h2>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182024"><span lang=EN>3.19.1 </span><span lang=EN>Overview</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>The “ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration”
message is used as the response to a “RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration”
message. It allows the sender to accept, decline, or offer conditions upon
which deployment duration of resources may be extended.</span></p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182025"><span lang=EN>3.19.2 </span><span lang=EN>Element
Reference Model</span></a></h3>

