Reference Model (ERM) tailored for the ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration
message. The </span><span lang=EN>ERM shows the element-level details for the
main entities in the RM.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN><img border=0 width=624 height=489
src="EDXL-RM-v1.0-OS-errata-os_files/image020.jpg"></span></p>

