<h3><a name="_Toc189182026">3.19.3 ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration
Message Rules</a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The following rules apply to the above elements:</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageID, ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:SentDateTime,
ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageContentType, ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:OriginatingMessageID,
ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:PrecedingMessageID, ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:ContactInformation,
and ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:ResourceInformation elements
MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The value of ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageContentType
MUST be “<span lang=EN>ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration</span>”.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:IncidentInformation
element is present, then at least one of IncidentInformation:IncidentID and/or
IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageRecall
element is present, then the MessageRecall:RecalledMessageID and
MessageRecall:RecallType elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:Funding element
is present, then at least one of Funding:FundCode and/or Funding:FundingInfo
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResourceInformation:ResourceInfoElementID and ResourceInformation:ResponseInformation
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>The ResponseInformation:PrecedingResourceInfoElementID and ResponseInformation:ResponseType
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResponseInformation:ResponseType element has a value of
“Accept” or “Provisional”, then ResourceInformation:Resource element MUST be
present. Otherwise, the ResourceInformation:Resource element is optional.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If ResponseInformation:ResponseType has a value of “Provisional”,
at least one of ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or ResponseInformation:ResponseReason
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a ResourceInformation:Resource element is present, then at
least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name, and/or Resource:TypeStructure elements
MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If a Resource:OwnershipInformation element is present, then at
least one of OwnershipInformation:Owner and/or OwnershipInformation:OwningJurisdiction
elements MUST be present.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>If the ResourceInformation:ScheduleInformation element is
present, then the ScheduleInformation:ScheduleType element MUST be present and contain
one of the following values: </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:.75in'><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span>“RequestedArrival”, “EstimatedArrival”, “ActualArrival”,
“RequestedDeparture”, “EstimatedDeparture”, “ActualDeparture”, “RequestedReturnArrival”,
“EstimatedReturnArrival”,  “RequestedReturnDeparture”, “EstimatedReturnDeparture”,
“Committed”, “EndAvailable”, “Current”, “ReportTo” or “Route”.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The schema for a ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration
message can be found in Appendix A.18.</p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182027"><span lang=EN>3.19.4 </span><span lang=EN>Message
Flow</span></a></h3>

<p class=MsoNormal>The ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration message is
sent from the Resource Supplier to the Resource Consumer in response to a
RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration message. </p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>The message may
be canceled or updated through the ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration:MessageRecall
element.</p>

<p class=MsoListBullet style='margin-left:0in;text-indent:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

