  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.08%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:
  none'>The system stamped date and time the resource message was sent. (1) The
  date and time is represented in <b><span style='font-family:"Arial,Bold","sans-serif"'>[dateTime]
  </span></b>format (e. g., &quot;<span style='font-family:Courier'>2002-05-24T16:49:00-07:00</span>&quot;
  for 24 May 2002 at 16: 49 PDT). (2) Alphabetic time zone designators such</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:
  none'>as “Z” MUST NOT be used. The time zone for UTC MUST be represented as
  “-00:00”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:
  none'>or “+00:00.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
