  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="16%" valign=top style='width:16.78%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="83%" valign=top style='width:83.22%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:3.05pt'><b>REQUIRED</b>, MUST be used
  at least once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="16%" valign=top style='width:16.78%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="83%" valign=top style='width:83.22%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>The contact associated with the resource message.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="16%" valign=top style='width:16.78%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="83%" valign=top style='width:83.22%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Refer to Section 4.1.13.1 for ContactInformationType</li>
   <li class=MsoNormal>There may be more than one contact given – message
       sender, requester, subject matter expert, approver, owner, etc.</li>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182031"></a><a name="_Toc156906368"></a><span lang=EN>4.1.2
</span><span lang=EN>IncidentInformation Element</span></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
