  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>If an IncidentInformation element is present, then at least one
  of IncidentInformation:IncidentID or IncidentInformation:IncidentDescription
  MUST be present</p>
  </td>
