  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Used to accept, decline, or provisionally accept a Request
  or Unsolicited Offer. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Value MUST be one of the following:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>1.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Accept</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>2.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Decline</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>3.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Provisional</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>The “ResponseReason” element is associated with a “Provisional”
  or “Decline” value.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>6,29</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ReasonCode</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ValueListType[XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Code from a managed list that offers an explanation for a
  declined or provisional response to a Request or Unsolicited Offer.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.05pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>If the ResponseInformation:ResponseType element has a value of
  “Provisional”, then at least one of the ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or
  ResponseInformation:ResponseReason elements MUST be present.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>6,29</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ResponseReason</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ResponseReasonType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Explanation for a declined or provisional response to a
  Request, Response, Unsolicited Offer, or a Request Return.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.05pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>If the ResponseInformation:ResponseType element has a value of
  “Provisional”, then at least one of the ResponseInformation:ReasonCode and/or
  ResponseInformation: ResponseReason elements MUST be present.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>6,29</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182036"></a><a name="_Toc156906375"></a><span lang=EN>4.1.7
</span><span lang=EN>Resource Element</span></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ResourceID</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ResourceIDType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and
  only once. </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>This identifier (if available) is used to identify and
  track a resource. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name or
       Resource:TypeStructure MUST be present to identify a specific resource
       and the same element and value MUST be used consistently within a
       sequence from a common Originating Message. </li>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Name</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ResourceNameType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and
  only once. </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>A name or title of the resource used for identification
  and tracking. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name or
       Resource:TypeStructure MUST be present to identify a specific resource
       and the same element and value MUST be used consistently within a
       sequence from a common Originating Message. </li>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,18,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>TypeStructure</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ValueListType [XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and
  only once</span><span lang=EN>. </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Uniform Resource Name (URN) paired with a string “keyword”
  value such as</p>
  <div style='border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:
  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:3.0pt 0in 3.0pt 0in;
  background:#E6E6E6;margin-left:10.4pt;margin-right:.3in'>
  <p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'> &lt;TypeStructure&gt;</p>
  <p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>    
  &lt;rm:ValueListURN&gt;urn:x-hazard:vocab:resourceTypes&lt;/rm:ValueListURN&gt;</p>
  <p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'> 
   &lt;rm:Value&gt;Debris Management Team&lt;/rm:Value&gt;</p>
  <p class=Codesmall style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:#E6E6E6'>&lt;/TypeStructure&gt;</p>
  </div>
  <p class=MsoNormal>for a certified list of resources maintained by the
  Community of Interest (for the value referenced.) </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>At least one of Resource:ResourceID, Resource:Name or Resource:TypeStructure
  MUST be present to identify a specific resource and the same element and
  value MUST be used consistently within a sequence from a common Originating
  Message for each Resource element present.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Refer to Section 4.1.13.3 for ValueListType</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,25, 26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>TypeInfo</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>TypeInfoType [sequence of xsd:any]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>The resource type as defined by either a Keyword structure
  or a valid schema.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>This element contains one or more child elements whose names
  and types depend on the value of the TypeStructure element.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,25,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Keyword</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ValueListType [XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used one or more
  times</span><span lang=EN> </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Any value from a discrete managed list, used to specify a
  keyword. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Allows reference to a separate schema for enumerations. Example:
       ValueListURN= &quot;http://www.dhs.gov/NiemEquipmentResources&quot; and Value=&quot;Portable
       Radio&quot;, <br>
       or ValueListURN= &quot;http://www.eic.org/Package&quot; and Value=&quot;DMAT
       – burn&quot;</li>
   <li class=MsoNormal>A Type Structure is assumed to have an enumerated, allowed
       list.</li>
   <li class=MsoNormal>A Keyword is not restricted to a particular enumeration,
       a Keyword can be any word or string.</li>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,25,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>DescriptionType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Free Text description of resource or resource
  characteristics, situation requiring resource assistance, or statement of
  mission the resource satisfies.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,7,16,18,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Credentials</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>CredentialsType<span style='color:black'> [xsd:string]</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and only
  once </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Statements of resource qualifications showing that a
  person or role has a right to exercise official power</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Multiple credentials may be included as a
       comma-separated list. <br>
       Example 1:  “Splinting, bandaging, oxygen administration”                   
       Example 2:  “A practitioner credentialed by a State to function as an
       EMT by a State Emergency Medical Services (EMS) system.”</li>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Certifications </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>CertificationsType<span style='color:black;background:
  white'> [xsd:string</span><span style='color:black'>]</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and only
  once</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Statements of recognition that a resource has met special
  requirements or qualifications within a field</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Multiple certifications may be included as a comma-separated list.
  <br>
  Example 1: “ALS; Advanced First Aid &amp; CPR, BLS; Advanced First Aid &amp;
  CPR”<br>
  Example 2: “<b><u>Pilot</u></b> – Commercial (instrument) or higher
  certificate and complete unit certification program”, “<b><u>Pilot</u></b> –
  Private Pilot (instrument) or higher certificate and complete unit
  certification program”<br>
  Example 3: “Trained to the HazMat First Responder Operational Level (NFPA
  472); Comply with organization; Operations Level for support personnel as
  outlined in NFPA 1670”</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN> </span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
