  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Any value from a discrete managed list, used to specify
  the general state of a resource if known.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Conditional Usage:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Required</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestReturn”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Optional:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
