  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Demobilized</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt'>&nbsp;</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>18</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Availability</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>AvailabilityType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Text to describe availability and limitations on
  availability. Resource availability refers to resource that it is present or
  ready for immediate use, or otherwise accessible or obtainable, or is qualified
  or willing to do something or to assume a responsibility. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Conditional Usage:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Required</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestReturn”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Optional:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “RequestInformation”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestInformation”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “OfferUnsolicitedResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ReleaseResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “RequestReturn”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestQuote”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ReportResourceDeploymentStatus”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “RequestExtendedDeploymentDuration”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestExtendedDeploymentDuration”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Not Applicable, otherwise</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182039"><span lang=EN>4.1.10 </span><span lang=EN>AssignmentInformation
Element</span></a></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Quantity</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>QuantityType [XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Description of amount of resource needed in both quantity
  and units of measure (if applicable).</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>This element carries quantity information expressed in one of
  two ways: </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>informally, as one or more lines of text (the QuantityText element);
  or</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>formally, as an element (the MeasuredQuantity element)
  containing an amount (required) and a unit of measure (optional).</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>The unit of measure is expressed,
  in turn, as a uniform resource name (ValueListURN) identifying a managed code
  list of units of measure, paired with a code from that list (identifying a
  particular unit of measure).</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>The use of the first alternative
  (the QuantityText element) is not recommended when the second alternative
  (the MeasuredQuantity element) can be used. For example, in a RequestResource
  message requesting 10000 liters of water, the second alternative (the MeasuredQuantity
  element) is the preferred one.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>A Community of Interest can
  either use an existing managed code list of units of measure, or define its
  own code list and use it. </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>One possibility is to use one of
  the two lists specified in the Unified Code for Units of Measure [UCUM]: case-sensitive
  codes (“c/s”) and case-insensitive codes (“c/i”). It is recommended that the
  two following URNs be used within EDXL-RM messages to identify those two code
  lists (respectively):</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in'><b>urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:ucum:1.6:cs</b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in'><b>urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:ucum:1.6:ci</b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Value MUST be non-negative.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Conditional Usage:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Required</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>EDXLResourceMessage:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestResource”
  and ResponseInformation:ResponseType = “Accept”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>EDXLResourceMessage:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestResource”
  and ResponseInformation:ResponseType = “Conditional”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>EDXLResourceMessage:MessageContentType = “RequisitionResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>EDXLResourceMessage:MessageContentType = “CommitResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:111.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>EDXLResourceMessage:MessageContentType = “ReleaseResource”</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Optional, otherwise.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>3,16,18,26</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Restrictions</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>RestrictionsType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, <span lang=EN>MAY be used once and only
  once </span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Description of a condition governing the availability of
  resources. E.g. condition for number of beds available may be &quot;if patients
  have insurance&quot;. This may be thought of as a term/condition or a
  restriction on availability.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>28</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>AnticipatedFunction</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>AnticipatedFunctionType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Anticipated function, task, job, or role to be provided by
  the requested resource.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>18,28</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>PriceQuote </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>PriceQuoteType [XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Description of quoted cost to acquire desired resource
  including currency, if the distinction is appropriate. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:39.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>This element carries price information expressed in one of two
  ways: </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>informally, as one or more lines of text (element
  QuantityText); or</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:75.1pt;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>formally, as an element (element MeasuredQuantity) containing
  an amount (required) and a unit of measure (optional).</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>The unit of measure is expressed,
  in turn, as a uniform resource name (ValueListURN) identifying a managed code
  list of units of measure, paired with a code from that list (identifying a
  particular unit of measure–usually a currency).</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>The use of the first alternative
  (the QuantityText element) is not recommended when the second alternative
  (the MeasuredQuantity element) can be used.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>A Community of Interest can
  either use an existing managed code list of units of measure, or define its
  own code list and use it. </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in'>Usually, the unit of measure is a
  currency and the code list consists of the alphabetic currency codes
  specified in [ISO 4217] and summarized in [ISO 4217 codes]. It is recommended
  that the following URN be used within EDXL-RM messages to identify the
  alphabetic currency code list specified in [ISO 4217]:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in'><b>urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:iso4217:a</b></p>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=disc>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Completed in response to a “RequestQuote”</li>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Conditional Usage:</li>
   <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=circle>
    <li class=MsoNormal>Required</li>
    <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=square>
     <li class=MsoNormal><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “ResponseToRequestQuote”</li>
     <li class=MsoNormal>May be indeterminate, i.e. “current market value.”</li>
    </ul>
    <li class=MsoNormal>Not Applicable</li>
    <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=square>
     <li class=MsoNormal><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “RequestResource”</li>
     <li class=MsoNormal><i>EDXLResourceMessage</i>:MessageContentType = “RequestQuote”</li>
    </ul>
    <li class=MsoNormal>Optional, otherwise </li>
   </ul>
  </ul>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
