<h3><a name="_Toc189182041"></a><a name="_Toc157322458"></a><span lang=EN>4.1.12
</span><span lang=EN>ScheduleInformation Element</span></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ScheduleType</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ScheduleTypeType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>REQUIRED</b>, MUST be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>A scheduled event that occurs at a particular time and/or
  at a particular location.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Value <u>MUST</u> be one of the following: </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>1.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>RequestedArrival</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>When the resource is needed. Completed for Resource requests,
  returns, etc.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>ICS uses the term &quot;delivery&quot; vs. &quot;arrival&quot;.
  “Arrival&quot; is used here because this applies to Human Resources also</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>2.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>EstimatedArrival</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource is expected to arrive at its “ReportTo”
  location.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>3.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>ActualArrival</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time when the resource arrives at its “ReportTo”
  location.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>4.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>RequestedDeparture</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time when the resource is requested to Depart from its
  current location for transit to a “ReportTo” location.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>5.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>EstimatedDeparture</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time when the resource is estimated to Depart from its
  current location for transit to a “ReportTo” location.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>6.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>ActualDeparture</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time when the resource Departs from its current location
  for transit to a “ReportTo” location.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>7.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>RequestedReturnArrival
  </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource is requested to arrive from its
  deployment at its “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>8.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>EstimatedReturnArrival
  </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource is expected to arrive from its
  deployment at its “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>9.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>ActualReturnArrival
  </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource arrives from its deployment at its
  “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>10.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>RequestedReturnDeparture </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource is requested to Depart from its
  deployment for transit to its “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>11.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>EstimatedReturnDeparture </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource is expected to Depart from its
  deployment for transit to its “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>12.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>ActualReturnDeparture </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource Departs from its deployment for
  transit to its “OwningJurisdiction”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>13.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>Committed </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Confirmation from Resource Supplier that resource has been
  allocated to Resource Consumer, usually in response to a
  “RequisitionResource” message.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>May be part of an “OriginatingMessage”.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>14.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>BeginAvailable </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource will become available for allocation.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>15.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>EndAvailable </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Date and time the resource will cease to be available for
  deployment.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>16.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>Current </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Location of resource at date and time of message.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>17.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>ReportTo </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Location of place where resource is to be delivered.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>May include a text description which explains to whom or where
  the resource should report upon arrival. This could include a name for a
  person, place or functional role.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>18.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp; </span>Route</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
  style='font-family:Wingdings'>§<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;
  </span></span>Information specifying the course of transit of resource from.Resource
  Supplier to Resource Consumer.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>2, 11, 12, 28, 30</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
