  <p class=MsoNormal>Location</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>LocationType [XML structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>The location in which a scheduled event takes place.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Information on the structure of LocationType can be found
  in Section 4.1.13.2. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<h3><a name="_Toc189182042"></a><a name="_Toc156906382"></a><a
name="_Toc156906383"></a><a name="_Toc156906384"></a><a name="_Toc156906385"></a><a
name="_Toc156906386"></a><a name="_Toc156906387"></a><a name="_Toc156906388"></a><a
name="_Toc156906389"></a><a name="_Toc156906390"></a><a name="_Toc156906391"></a><a
name="_Toc156906392"></a><span lang=EN>4.1.13 </span><span lang=EN>Supporting
Element Types</span></h3>

<h4><a name="_Toc189182043"></a><a name="_Ref188808784">4.1.13.1 <span lang=EN>ContactInformationType</span></a><span
lang=EN> </span></h4>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><img border=0
width=270 height=241 src="EDXL-RM-v1.0-OS-errata-os_files/image021.jpg"></p>

<p class=MsoCaption>Figure 20: ContactInformationType Structure</p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ContactDescription</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ContactDescriptionType [xsd:string]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Identifying information associated with a contact role related
  to the resource message.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>If a ContactInformation element is present, then at least one
  of ContactInformation:ContactDescription or ContactInformation:ContactRole
  MUST be present.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>The ContactDescription element is free text information
  identifying a contact that acts as an alternative to the ContactRole element
  for roles that are not covered by the ContactRole enumeration. The
  identifying information should be as specific as possible but can be suitably
  flexible (e.g. “Accounts Payable Clerk”).</p>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>The element contains information associated with the contact
  role that is easily understood by humans but that is not necessarily usable
  by automation systems.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>18,23,24</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ContactRole</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ContactRoleType [xsd:string enumeration] ]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>CONDITIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Role of the contact associated with the resource message.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <ul style='margin-top:0in' type=square>
   <li class=MsoNormal>If a ContactInformation element is present, then at
       least one of ContactInformation:ContactDescription or ContactInformation:ContactRole
       MUST be present</li>
   <li class=MsoNormal>Value MUST be one of the following: </li>
  </ul>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>1.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&quot;Sender&quot;
  (who sent the message)</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>2.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>”Requester&quot;
  (authorization for the message / request)</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>3.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&quot;SubjectMatterExpert&quot;
  (answer questions or provide details)</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>4.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&quot;Approver&quot;</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>5.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&quot;RespondingOrg&quot;
  (who responded to the message) </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.25in'>6.<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>“Owner”</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>18,23,24</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>ContactLocation</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>LocationType [XML Structure]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>The geophysical location of the contact.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Constraints</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>If a PostalAddress needs to be included, an
  AdditionalContactInformation element MUST be included, and MUST be placed in
  the xAL:Address element within the AdditionalContactInformation element.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Information on the structure of LocationType can be found in
  Section 4.1.13.2.</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Requirements Supported</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>18,23,24</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="97%"
 style='width:97.32%'>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>Element</b></p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>AdditionalContactInformation</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Type</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:
  none'>AdditionalContactInformationType [xpil:PartyType]</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Usage</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b>OPTIONAL</b>, MAY be used once and only once. </p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Definition</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Any other contact information including name and other Party
  information.</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="15%" valign=top style='width:15.26%;background:#CCCCEE;padding:
  3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal>Comments</p>
  </td>
  <td width="84%" valign=top style='width:84.74%;padding:3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt 3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>The AdditionalContactInformation element is an xpil:PartyType
  structure that includes an xal:AddressType. </p>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>If the optional AdditionalContactInformation element is
  included, the physical postal address should be included in the AdditionalContactInformation
  xal:Address element. Otherwise, it may be included in the ContactLocation
  element.</p>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>The CIQ xpil:PartyType can specify person name, Organization
  name, contact phone numbers, email addresses, street addresses, etc. suitable
  for use in any country. This is the element that should be used to capture
  most of the contact information. </p>
  <p class=MsoListBullet><span style='font-family:Symbol'>·<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
  </span></span>Example:</p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>        <span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>&lt;rm:AdditionalContactInformation&gt;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>            &lt;xnl:PartyName&gt;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                &lt;xnl:PersonName&gt;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                    &lt;xnl:NameElement
  xnl:ElementType=&quot;FirstName&quot;&gt;Joe</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                  &lt;/xnl:NameElement&gt;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                    &lt;xnl:NameElement
  xnl:ElementType=&quot;LastName&quot;&gt;Williams</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                  &lt;/xnl:NameElement&gt;</span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;
  font-family:"Courier New"'>                &lt;/xnl:PersonName&gt;</span></p>
