  </span></span>For EDXL-RM gml:posList layout MUST be used. </p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
  margin-left:21.3pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>&nbsp;</p>
