<p class=MsoNormal>An&nbsp;XML 1.0 element&nbsp;is a conforming Level-1 EDXL-RM
Message if and only if:</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in'>a)<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>it meets the
general requirements specified in Section 3.3;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in'>b)<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if its namespace
name is <span lang=NL>&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:msg&quot;,
then its local name is one of the 16 resource message type names specified in
sections </span>3.4 to 3.19 <span lang=NL>(also listed in </span>Table 1<span lang=NL>), and the element </span>is valid according to the schema located at <br>
<span class=MsoHyperlink><a href="https://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/EDXL-RM/EDXL-RM.xsd">http://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/EDXL-RM/EDXL-RM.xsd</a></span>,
where validation is performed against the global element declaration with the
same local name;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in'>c)<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if its
namespace name is not <span lang=NL>&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:msg&quot;,
then the element </span>is valid according to the schema located at <br>
<span class=MsoHyperlink><a href="https://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/EDXL-RM/EDXL-RM.xsd">http://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/EDXL-RM/EDXL-RM.xsd</a></span>,
where validation is performed against the complex type definition
“EDXLResourceMessageReferenceType”;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in'>d)<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if its namespace
name is <span lang=NL>&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:EDXL:RM:1.0:msg&quot;,
